  "body": "Complete raw artifacts for the 2026-11-04 familiarity and residual round.\n\n- 96 new familiarity-switch selectors on two fixed class partitions, with original predictions and training/evaluation records.\n- 18 learned residual branches, nine frozen shared bases, raw predictions, and three forward-restoration examples.\n- Six candidate-preference/discrimination diagnostics.\n- Three archives, 1,229,381,730 bytes total. Local and GitHub asset integrity verified; sampled GitHub model restoration passed.\n\nScientific summaries, figures, protocols, and restore details are in results/familiarity-residual-v1/ on main. Role-oriented frequency changes are candidate-preference effects, not ordinary accuracy gains.\n"
